Subject: [PATCH 18/55] Guide: authentic gamer profile creation
 (createprofile.xex flow)

XamShowCreateProfileUIEx is routed to the Guide overlay: vk's gamertag
keyboard, the name normalization and validation with the console's error
boxes, Save Gamer Profile (Done creates and signs in; Join Xbox Live and
Customize Profile show Can't Connect offline). Also dumps createprofile,
vk and gamerprofile for reference.

